@startuml
!theme plain

title CARD#5 v0.1.1 to multi-rule migration with rollback

hide empty description
top to bottom direction

[*] --> V011

state "v0.1.1 active" as V011
state "Preflight evidence ready" as Preflight
state "Maintenance: no standard ARA-M" as NoAra
state "Multi-rule applet installed\nunprovisioned" as NewEmpty
state "Multi-rule catalog verified" as NewReady
state "Rollback v0.1.1 restored" as Rollback
state "Stop: preserve v0.1.1" as Stop

V011 --> Preflight : export current rule; retain no secrets\nverify rollback CAP and multi-rule canary
V011 --> Stop : any preflight gate fails

Preflight --> NoAra : remove card from Android\ndelete old standard package/instance
NoAra --> NewEmpty : load/install multi-rule release\nat standard ARA-M AID
NewEmpty --> NewReady : restore exported rule first\nreconcile desired N rules\nverify FF40/FF60, DF20, raw E2=6982

NoAra --> Rollback : new load/install fails
NewEmpty --> Rollback : provisioning/readback fails
Rollback --> V011 : reinstall verified v0.1.1 CAP\nrestore exported rule and verify

NewReady --> [*]
Stop --> [*]

note bottom of NoAra
The standard ARA-M AID cannot be held by both versions at once.
The maintenance interval is fail-closed on Android; rollback assets
and the exported rule are mandatory before deleting v0.1.1.
end note

@enduml
